<title>USA: Three Rivers Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Three Rivers Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>THREE RIVERS, Mich. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Rivers Financial Corp said Thursday it intended to repurchase up to 85,124 shares of its common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>The holding company for First Savings Bank has 851,240 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The stock repurchase was approved by the Office of Thrift Supervision on October 31, it said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
